# ============================================
# Important Notes
# ============================================
# 1. NEVER commit .env files (contains API keys)
# 2. NEVER commit API keys or secrets
# 3. NEVER commit database dumps with sensitive data
# 4. NEVER commit large binary files (videos, images)
# 5. NEVER commit cache files
# 6. NEVER commit build artifacts
# 7. NEVER commit temporary files
# 8. NEVER commit logs with sensitive information
# 9. ALWAYS keep .gitignore updated
# 10. ALWAYS use .env.example as template

# ============================================
# Version Control
# ============================================
